:: day1ft_door_hub [nobr]
<h2>🚪 The Door</h2>
<p>Heavy oak. Corridor sounds filter through.</p>

<<set _aldricCard to ($d1ft_exam and not $d1ft_npc_aldric_door and $timeSlot === "AFTERNOON")>>
<<set _naraCard to ($d1ft_alone and not $d1ft_npc_nara3 and $d1_npc_nara)>>
<<set _queenCard to ($timeSlot === "EVENING" and not $d1ft_npc_queen_message)>>
<<set _ashCard to ($timeSlot === "EVENING" and $d1ft_npc_queen_message and not $d1ft_ash)>>
<<set _martaCard to ($d1ft_ash and not $d1ft_npc_marta_tray)>>

<<if _aldricCard>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "aldric" "Aldric">>
  <h4>🗡 Familiar Footsteps</h4>
  <p>Heavy. Even. The cadence of a man who has never been in a hurry. He stops outside. He doesn't know what he's protecting now.</p>
  [[Listen → |day1ft_npc_aldric_door]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if _naraCard>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "nara" "Nara">>
  <h4>🎵 Three Notes Repeating</h4>
  <p>A music box. A tentative knock. "I brought tea because tea helps everything..." She might know more than she's saying.</p>
  [[Open the door → |day1ft_npc_nara3]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if _queenCard>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <h4>📜 A Sealed Note</h4>
  <p>Not Ash's knock. Formal. A hand extends through the gap. The royal seal   from someone who doesn't know what you kept.</p>
  [[Take the note → |day1ft_npc_queen_message]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if _ashCard>>
<div class="interaction-card main">
  <<npcPortrait $bardPortraitSlug "Ash">>
  <h4>🎵 Three Taps. Pause. Two More.</h4>
  <p>Ash. Playing softly through the door. The one person you can tell everything.</p>
  [[Open the door → |day1_ash_futa]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if _martaCard>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "marta" "Marta">>
  <h4>🍞 A Tray on the Floor</h4>
  <p>It wasn't there before. Covered with a clean cloth. Someone who doesn't need to know what's under your nightgown.</p>
  [[Pick it up → |day1ft_npc_marta_tray]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if not (_aldricCard or _naraCard or _queenCard or _ashCard or _martaCard)>>
  <p class="empty-note">The corridor is quiet. No footsteps. No knocks. Just stone and silence.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Back to room → |day1_hub_futa]]
</div>
